msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Golden Agu's supposed to be super tasty. I heard my mom talking to all her "
"friends about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Agu? You mean pork, right? I've never heard of any \"Golden Agu\" before..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"They say it'll make you beautiful if you eat enough. It's\r\n"
"chock-full of collagen, which makes your skin brighter and\r\n"
"healthier, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"And I've even heard it helps you lose weight, since it has\r\n"
"some kind of fat-burning nutrients."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Maybe they're selling it at the Public Market. They've got\r\n"
"pretty much everything there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"(Pork that makes you beautiful just by eating it? That\r\n"
"Golden Agu sure must be something...)"
msgstr ""

